# Phase 11 Commit 2 — audit item from mục 1 of docs/phase-11-plan.md (the 11 .NET Dockerfiles
# were already multi-stage from earlier phases and never needed this since `dotnet restore`/
# `publish` only touch what's COPYed explicitly; the 3 new Next.js Dockerfiles COPY the whole
# repo into the build stage, so node_modules/.git bloating the build context is a real cost here).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
**/bin
**/obj
# Local development credentials and host URLs must never enter a Docker build context.  Besides
# avoiding accidental secret inclusion, this keeps Next from baking the host-only .env.local
# values into its standalone production output; the Dockerfile supplies its deliberate K8s build
# values instead and the Deployment supplies server-only runtime configuration.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
